grid 1.1 e mhconga 3363.3..|3363.3..
grid 1.1 e hconga  ......76|......76
grid 1.1 e lconga  ....3...|....3...
track d2
1.1.0 crash 480 80
# the campana (cowbell) on every beat, the downbeats strong
grid 1.1 q cowbell 7565|7565
grid 1.1 e htimbale .......6|...5...6
track pc
grid 1.1 e maracas 43434343|43434343
track ba
1.2.240 G1 600 102
1.4.0  C2 680 110
2.2.240 E2 600 100
2.4.0  C2 680 110
track c1
