grid 1.1 e E4+G4+C5 ..x..x..|x..x..xx len=200
track c2
# trombones: a mambo riff, short and punchy, on the and of 2 and the and of 4
1.2.240 E4+G4+C5 160 100
1.3.0  E4+G4+C5 120 86
1.4.240 E4+G4+C5 200 104
2.2.240 G4+C5+E5 160 100
2.3.0  G4+C5+E5 120 86
2.4.240 E4+G4+C5 200 104
track c3
1.1.0  G3+C4+E4 1920 58
2.1.0  G3+C4+E4 1920 54

